//Spellcasting.
@1000 = "Spellcasting Initial Level Bonus"
@1001 = "Gives a permanent bonus of +4 to divine casting level."

@1010 = "Paladin Spellbook"
@1011 = "Trims down the Paladin spellbook."

@1020 = "Spell Slot Penalty"
@1021 = "Gives a penalty of -1 spell slot for divine spells in levels 1 through 5."

@1030 = "Spellcasting per Level Bonus"
@1031 = "Gives a permanent bonus of +1 to divine caster level."

//Immunities.
@1100 = "Disease Immunity"
@1101 = "Gives permanent immunity to disease."

@1110 = "Immunity to Fear"
@1111 = "Gives permanent immunity to fear."

@1120 = "Immunity to Charm"
@1121 = "Gives permanent immunity to charm."

@1130 = "Immunity to Paralysis"
@1131 = ~Gives permanent immunity to hold and paralyze.~

@1140 = "Immunity to Confusion"
@1141 = "Gives permanent immunity to confusion."


//Existing abilities.
@1200 = "Lay on Hands"
@1201 = "Lay on Hands
Level: 1
School: Necromancy
Range: Touch
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Creature
Saving Throw: None

With this ability, the Paladin heals a target for 2 hit points per caster level, up to 40 hit points at 20th level. At 6th level, it cures the target from any disease. At 9th level, it also neutralizes any poison and intoxication effects."

@1210 = "Detect Evil"
@1211 = "Detect Evil
Level: 1
School: Divination
Range: Personal
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 30' radius
Saving Throw: None

With this ability, the Paladin discovers emanations of evil from any creature. Any evil creature within the range of the spell will briefly glow red."

@1220 = "Protection From Evil"
@1221 = "Protection From Evil
Level: 1
School: Abjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: 24 hours
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None 

When the Paladin casts this spell, he becomes protected from a magical barrier raised at a distance of one foot. The barrier moves with him and has two major effects: first, all attacks made by evil creatures against the protected creature receive a -2 penalty to their attack roll, and second, any saving throws caused by such attacks are made by the protected creature with a +2 bonus."

//New abilities.
@1300 = "Smite Evil"
@1301 = "Smite Evil
Level: 1
School: Necromancy
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 round
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

During the round when this ability is activated the Paladin gains +2 bonus to attack rolls against evil creatures, and any melee hit against an evil creature inflicts 1d6 additional points of magic damage. For every 4 levels, the damage done increases by 1d6, up to a maximum of 5d6 at 16th level."

//Auras.
@1400 = "Aura of Hope"
@1401 = "Permanent aura inflicting -1 thac0 penalty to every evil enemy within range. At level 14, it also inflicts a penalty of -1 to damage rolls on every evil enemy within range and at level 17 grants a bonus of +1 to all saves of every ally within range."

//Cavalier abilities.
@2000 = "Cavalier Spellbook"
@2001 = "Trims down the Cavalier spellbook."

@2100 = "Cavalier Shield Specialization"
@2101 = "Gives specialization in Sword and Shield style."

//Spells.
@2200 = "Shield Other"
@2201 = "Shield Other
Level: 1
School: Abjuration
Range: Long
Duration: 5 rounds
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Target
Saving Throw: None

When the Cavalier casts a Shield Other spell on an ally, it causes all of his opponents to ignore his existence, as if he were invisible. While protected by this spell, the ally cannot take direct offensive action without breaking the spell, but may use non-attack spells focused on himself or otherwise act in any way that does not violate the prohibition against offensive action. This allows him to heal his wounds, for example, or to cast protection spells on himself. He cannot cast spells on other targets without ending the effects of the spell."

@2210 = "Shield of Faith"
@2211 = "Shield of Faith
Level: 2
School: Abjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

This spell grants the Paladin a +2 bonus to armor class and saves vs. breath for one turn. The bonus increases by +1 at level 11 and then again at level 16. Multiple castings of this spell are not cumulative."

@2220 = "Divine Retaliation"
@2221 = "Divine Retaliation
Level: 2
School: Evocation
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell protects the Cavalier from attacks made within a 5' radius of the caster. Opponents that hit the caster with a weapon or spell from within this radius will suffer 1d8+4 points of magic damage. Multiple castings of this spell are not cumulative, but it can be used in conjunction with similar effects. The retaliation is not affected by magic resistance."

@2230 = "Heroism"
@2231 = "Heroism
Level: 3
School: Enchantment
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: 30' radius
Saving Throw: None

Upon uttering this spell, the Paladin and his allies' morale are raised by 2, as well as attack and damage rolls. Furthermore, affected creatures hit points are raised by 10%, and these bonus hit points are lost first when the recipient takes damage. The caster determines at what range he will cast the spell. At the instant the spell is completed, it affects all creatures in a 30 feet radius centered on the point selected by the caster."

@2240 = "Hold the Line"
@2241 = "Hold the Line
Level: 3
School: Alteration
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

When the Cavalier casts this spell he becomes protected against any effects that would repel him, like knockback, Dragon's wing buffet, etc."

//Auras.
@2400 = "Aura of Righteousness"
@2401 = "Permanent aura granting a bonus of +1 to ac to every ally within range. At level 14 it also grants a bonus of +1 to melee thac0 and at level 17, a bonus of +1 to melee damage."

//Inquisitor abilities.
//Spellcasting.
@3000 = "Disable Spellcasting"
@3001 = "Disables Spellcasting."

@3010 = "Disable Turn Undead"
@3011 = "Disables Turn Undead."

//Existing abilities.
@3100 = "True Sight"
@3101 = "True Sight
Level: 5
School: Divination
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 30' radius
Saving Throw: None 

With this ability, the Inquisitor gains the ability to see the exact locations of creatures or objects under displacement or invisibility effects, and see through illusions. This effectively neutralize spells such as Blur and Mirror Image, allow the Inquisitor to see and target invisible creatures normally, and make him unaffected by hostile illusion spells such as Spook and Shadow Door. The Inquisitor is also cured from any form of blindness and is immune to it for the duration of the spell. The effects of this ability cannot be dispelled.

Note: True Seeing does not dispel illusionary clones such as those conjured by Mislead or Simulacrum, but instead clearly highlights them, revealing them as deceptions."

@3110 = "Dispel Evil"
@3111 = "Dispel Evil
Level: 1
School: Abjuration
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 15' radius
Saving Throw: None

With this ability, the Inquisitor removes magical effects upon every evil enemy within the area. This includes effects given from spells and certain magical items such as wands. It does not, however, affect enchanted magical items or spell protections such as Spell Turning and Spell Deflection. The chance of the dispel succeeding is determined by the level of the Inquisitor, counted as 1.5 times higher, and the level of the magic being dispelled. The base chance of successfully dispelling is 50%. For every level that the Inquisitor of the Dispel Magic is above the target, <PRO_HISHER> chance of success increases by 5%. For every level that the Inquisitor is below the target, <PRO_HISHER> chance of success decreases by 10%. However, despite the difference in levels, there is always at least a 5% chance of success or failure.

Note: While this spell dispels the individual effects of Grease, Web, Stinking Cloud, and other such spells, it does not dispel the area of effect."

//New abilities.
@3200 = "Banish Evil"
@3201 = "Banish Evil
Level: 6
School: Abjuration
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: 30' radius
Saving Throw: None

With this ability, the Inquisitor banishes evil, enemy summoned creatures in the area back to their proper plane. Magic resistance does not affect this spell."

@3210 = "Inquisitor's Shield"
@3211 = "Inquisitor's Shield
Level: 1
School: Abjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

With this powerful abjuration, the Inquisitor can protect himself with a shield deflecting all spells cast directly at him. This ability will not protect the caster from dispel magic, but it will not be affected by dispel magic, either.

This ability also grants protection from spells cast from scrolls and innate spell-like abilities, but will not protect against area effects not centered directly upon the caster (such as Fireball), or stationary area effects (such as those from Cloudkill and Stinking Cloud)."

@3300 = "Iron Will"
@3301 = "Gives a permanent bonus of +1 to Save vs. spells."

//Auras.
@3400 = "Aura of Faith"
@3401 = "Permanent aura granting a bonus of +5% to magic resistance to every ally within range. At level 14, allies also gain protection from evil and at level 17 they also gain a +1 bonus to all saves."

//Undead hunter spells abilities.
@4000 = "Undead Hunter Spellbook"
@4001 = "Trims down the Unded Hunter spellbook."

@4010 = "Turn Undead Bonus"
@4011 = "Grants a permanent bonus of +2 to Turn Undead level."

//Immunities.
@4100 = "Immunity to Level Drain"
@4101 = "Gives permanent immunity to level drain."

//New abilities.
@4200 = "Undead Bane"
@4201 = "Undead Bane
Level: 1
School: Necromancy
Range: Personal
Duration: 5 turns
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

For the duration of the spell, the Undead Hunter has a bonus of +2 to thac0 and damage against undead. This bonus improves by 1 every 4 levels to a maximum of +4 at level 12. Multiple castings of this spell are not cumulative."

@4210 = "Smite Undead"
@4211 = "Smite Undead
Level: 1
School: Necromancy
Range: Long
Duration: Instant
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: 20' radius
Saving Throw: Spell half

With this spell the Undead Hunter draws down holy power to smite the undead. Undead creatures within the area of effect take 12d4 points of magic damage, with a successful saving throw vs. spell for half at a penalty of -2. Magic resistance does not affect this ability."

@4220 = "Protection From Undead"
@4221 = "Protection From Undead
Level: 1
School: Abjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: 24 Hours
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None 

When the Undead Hunter uses this ability, he becomes protected from a magical barrier raised at a distance of one foot. The barrier moves with him and has two major effects: first, all attacks made by undead creatures against him receive a -2 penalty to their attack roll, and second, any saving throws caused by such attacks are made with a +2 bonus."

//New spells.
@4300 = "Halt Undead"
@4301 = "Halt Undead
Level: 1
School: Necromancy
Range: Long
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 1
Area of Effect: Target, and enemies within 5'
Saving Throw: Spell negates

This spell stops undead creatures in their place for the duration of the spell. The effect is centered on the victim selected by the caster. Any undead creatures within 5 feet of the target are also affected. Those who succeed at a saving throw vs. spell at -2 are totally unaffected by the spell. Magic resistance does not affect this spell."

@4310 = "Magic Circle against Undead"
@4311 = "Magic Circle against Undead
Level: 2
School: Abjuration
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 Turn
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Party
Saving Throw: None 

When the Undead Hunter casts this spell, every party member becomes protected from a magical barrier raised at a distance of one foot. The barrier moves with the protected creature and has two major effects: first, all attacks made by undead creatures against the protected creature receive a -2 penalty to their attack roll, and second, any saving throws caused by such attacks are made by the protected creature with a +2 bonus."

@4320 = "Exorcism"
@4321 = "Exorcism
Level: 3
School: Necromancy
Range: Personal
Duration: 1 turn
Casting Time: 3
Area of Effect: Caster
Saving Throw: None

For the duration of this spell, any undead creature struck in melee by the Undead Hunter must make a save vs. spell or be destroyed. The save gains a penalty of -1 at level 17, increased to -2 at level 20. This spell is not affected by magic resistance. Multiple castings of Exorcism are not cumulative."

@4340 = "Animate Skeleton Warrior"
@4341 = "Animate Skeleton Warrior
Level: 4
School: Necromancy
Range: Medium
Duration: 5 turns
Casting Time: 1 round
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

High-level Undead Hunters can use their necromantic powers to seek out and destroy undead abominations. With this spell, the Undead Hunter animates the corpse of a powerful skeleton warrior to aid him in battle. This powerful undead creature will remain under the caster's control until it is slain or the spell duration expires."

